<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    English mirror of res/values/strings.xml (which is the Russian original).

    Every name in values/ has to exist here, because a missing one is not a
    missing word: Android falls back to the default locale for that name alone,
    so one hole shows a Russian row in the middle of an English screen.
    `ResourceTranslationTest` in src/test/ is what keeps the two files level.
-->
